  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> this feature may not be described accurately as it is unclear whether it works the same way for every player.</i></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5e/Admit_One.png/revision/latest?cb=20141230142909\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A ticket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A ticket\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"173\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A ticket</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Movie Ticket</b> is a game feature where players can use tickets to get random prizes.\n</p><p>The feature is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 10.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Getting tickets</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players are given four tickets every day. After the first in game purchase (with real money) you will only have two tickets but there will be no ads to watch anymore.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Note</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players who confirmed under the age of 16 does not get any personalised advertisements, movie tickets does not appear nor generate on their farms under the newspaper.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Prizes</b></span></h3>\n<p>Prizes include <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a>.\n</p><p>Decorations offered as prizes vary seasonally. September 2023 prizes included: \n</p>\n<ul><li>Autumn Lantern</li>\n<li>Autumn Wheelbarrow</li>\n<li>Cow Fence</li>\n<li>Gnome Fisherman</li>\n<li>Log Path</li>\n<li>Rake Leafs</li>\n<li>Round Hay-bales</li>\n<li>Tractor</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Gallery</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ANight_at_the_Movies.png\" title=\"Night at the Movies.png (115 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a2/Night_at_the_Movies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/233?cb=20141230141542\" title=\"Night at the Movies.png (115 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"First trailer\" height=\"185\" width=\"233\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Night at the Movies.png (115 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"First trailer\" height=\"185\" width=\"233\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">First trailer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ANight_at_the_Movies-other_trailer.png\" title=\"Night at the Movies-other trailer.png (114 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Night_at_the_Movies-other_trailer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/234?cb=20141230142151\" title=\"Night at the Movies-other trailer.png (114 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Another trailer\" height=\"185\" width=\"234\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Night at the Movies-other trailer.png (114 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Another trailer\" height=\"185\" width=\"234\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Another trailer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ANight_at_the_Movies-max.png\" title=\"Night at the Movies-max.png (110 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c5/Night_at_the_Movies-max.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/233?cb=20141230143309\" title=\"Night at the Movies-max.png (110 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"No other available trailer\" height=\"185\" width=\"233\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Night at the Movies-max.png (110 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"No other available trailer\" height=\"185\" width=\"233\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">No other available trailer</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829221224\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 84/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 402/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 145/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4691/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.998      1 -total\n 13.92%    1.809 